    "chunk_text": "\u00fea cw\u00e6don \u00f0a apostoli to \u00f0am drymannum; Ge arleasan.gehyra\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t halige gewrit \u00f0e \u00feus cwe\u00f0; Se \u00f0e o\u00f0erne wyle beswican.\u00e6rest he beswic\u00f0 hine sylfne; \u00d0yssera n\u00e6ddrena geslit eow mihte to dea\u00f0e gebringan.o\u00fe\u00fee langlice geswencan.ac nu binnon \u00deas \u00f0ry dagas ge beo\u00f0 gedrehte \u00fe\u00e6t eow of\u00f0ince eower gedwyld; \u00d0a heton \u00f0a apostoli hi aberan to heora inne.and hi \u00f0rim dagum ne onbirigdon \u00e6tes.ne w\u00e6tes.ac \u00c6fter \u00f0an \u00f0riddan d\u00e6ge \u00fea \u00fea hi fornean w\u00e6ron adydde.\u00f0a comon begen \u00fea apostoli.and Nele se \u00e6lmihtiga god habban genydne \u00feeowdom.arisa\u00f0 nu hale.and habba\u00f0 eow agenne cyre.to Hi \u00f0a \u00feurhwunodon on heora geleafleaste.and \u00e6tflugon \u00feam apostolum swa swa hi \u00e6r \u00e6tflugon \u00dea b\u00e6d se cyning Xerxes.and his ealdorman uuarardah \u00f0a apostolas \u00fe\u00e6t hi \u00f0\u00e6r wunian sceoldon. Hi h\u00e6fdon him mid fela leorningcnihta.of \u00f0am hi hadodon m\u00e6ssepreostas.and diaconas.and fela \u00dea wear\u00f0 an \u00f0\u00e6ra diacona eufrosinus betogen forligres.ac \u00f0a apostoli heton l\u00e6dan for\u00f0 \u00feone \u00d0a apostoli cw\u00e6don to \u00f0am cilde; We halsia\u00f0 \u00fee on naman h\u00e6lendes cristes.",
